  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p><strong>Prerequisite:</strong> Emotion class feature.</p>\n<p><strong>Benefit:</strong> You may enhance an emotion power that has a range of touch and a single target to extend the range to 30 feet and the maximum number of targets to be equal to your casting ability modifier. Each target of the emotion power must be within close range of each other as well as you. If the power grants a saving throw to resist, the DC is reduced by 2. Using an emotion power in this way costs 3 daily uses of the power instead of 1.</p>\n<p><a href=\"http://spheresofpower.wikidot.com/eliciter#toc39\">Source: Spheres of Power Wiki</a></p>",
